#override while running the ansible playbook
ansible-playbook playbook.yaml -e "node_config=[{'host':'abbie','threshold':0.25}]"

2
separate  variable file for each client
ansible-playbook playbook.yaml -e @var_client1.yaml


an update about variable overides in ansible
To handle variable overrides, we will create a separate variable file for each host in Ansible.
When running the playbook, we will specify which variable file to use.
This allows us to use different threshold values for each site
The playbook will be run like this:
ansible-playbook playbook.yaml -e @kcg.yaml
